Source: sccache
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Krysztal Huang <krysztal.huang@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 {{RUST_PACKAGE_NAME}} (= {{RUST_PACKAGE_VERSION}}),
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 libssl-dev,
 pkgconf,
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: {{SOURCE_GIT}}
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: sccache
Architecture: any
Depends: ca-certificates, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: compiler cache for fast recompilation of C/C++/Rust code
 sccache speeds up recompilation by caching previous compilation results and
 reusing them when the same compilation is requested again. It supports C,
 C++, and Rust and can store cached objects locally or in remote storage.
